-    "how do i run pixel",
-    "how to use pixel",
-    "how to run pixel",
-    "how do i install pixel",
-    "how to install pixel",
-    "how is pixel installed",
-    "explain pixel",
-    "describe pixel",
-    "tell me about pixel",
-    "pixel help",
-    "pixel documentation",
